 /*********************************************************************/
 /* Program     : CBACT03C.PLI                                        */
 /* Application : CardDemo                                            */
 /* Type        : IMS Batch PL/I Program (BMP)                        */
 /* Function    : Card Cross-Reference Data Refresh                   */
 /* Converted from COBOL batch: app/cbl/CBACT03C.cbl                 */
 /*********************************************************************/
